	This template is plumbing only. Placeholders in double braces are filled from settings.json and secrets.json at build time.
	Everything the install actually does lives in Scripts\<phase>\ - see README.md.
	Each component is listed once per architecture (amd64, arm64); Windows Setup uses the one matching the install media.
